{title: He Took My Sins Away}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]I came to Jesus, [C]weary, worn and [G]sad.
He [D7]took my sins away;
He [G]took my sins away.
And now His love has [C]made my heart so [G]glad.
He [C]took my [D7]sins  [G]away

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]The load of sin was [C]more than I could [G]bear.
He [D7]took them all away;
He [G]took them all away.
And now on Him I [C]roll my ev'ry [G]care.
He [C]took my [D7]sins  [G]away.

{comment: Verse 3}
[G]No condemnation [C]have I in my [G]heart.
He [D7]took my sins away;
He [G]took my sins away.
His perfect peace He [C]did to me [G]impart.
He [C]took my [D7]sins  [G]away.

{comment: Verse 4}
[G]If you will come to [C]Jesus Christ to[G]day,
He'll [D7]take your sins away;
He'll [G]take your sins away.
And keep you happy [C]in His love each [G]day.
He'll [C]take your [D7]sins  [G]away.

{comment: Refrain}
He [D7]took my sins away;
He [G]took my sins away,
And [A7]keeps singing ev'er [D]day!
[G]I'm so glad He [C]took my sins [G]away.
He [C]took my [D7]sins  [G]away
